    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey... im feeling really wiped out today. like super exhausted. my left arm feels kinda weird too, just really heavy and hard to move. and i feel like im tripping over my words a bit when i try to talk. i think i just need a long nap to sleep this off, do u think that'll help?",
