    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm just really tired and i don't really want to deal with a doctor right now if i don't have to. it's probably just stress or something. if i take some benadryl or maybe an extra strength sleeping pill it'll help me just sleep through this heavy feeling, right? i just want to sleep it off.",
