      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I would advise against relying on over-the-counter medications like Benadryl or dark-work sleeping pills without consulting a doctor first. These can interact with other medications, worsen existing conditions, or even precipitate conditions like blood clots or respiratory depression, especially if you have pre-existing medical conditions or take other prescription medications. Instead, try to establish a relaxing bedtime routine to help you unwind and address your stress.",
