      "content": "well i'm not taking any other meds, just the sleeping pill. i'm pretty sure i'm just burnt out. honestly the slurring is barely even there, i just feel heavy. is there anything else i can do to just make sure i can sleep deeply and not wake up feeling like this? i really just want to sleep this off and feel better in the morning.",
